00:00:25.183 --> 00:00:30.521
The truth is, Miss Tsujidou has been
lonely since Mafuyu and the others left.

00:00:30.521 --> 00:00:33.888
M-Miss Mitarai! There's no need
to speak of such things!

00:00:35.426 --> 00:00:38.623
You know, I just finished running a bath.

00:00:39.263 --> 00:00:40.958
Care to join me?

00:00:41.766 --> 00:00:43.097
A bath?

00:00:43.434 --> 00:00:46.301
I'm Right Breasts!

00:00:46.704 --> 00:00:48.763
I-I'm Left Breasts.

00:00:49.474 --> 00:00:52.136
