else in your repertoire?

00:01:04.722 --> 00:01:07.492
"Flat and smooth..."
We're doing well, Sasha... Mafuyu...

00:01:07.492 --> 00:01:09.585
We're doing well, Sasha... Mafuyu...

00:01:18.536 --> 00:01:20.527
Sasha...

00:01:26.310 --> 00:01:36.854
Trance, nureta tsumi ga yobu shoudou

00:01:36.854 --> 00:01:41.018
Modokashii aserasareta kodou

00:01:42.026 --> 00:01:45.826
Kimi wa aizu mo mushi datta

00:01:47.231 --> 00:01:52.032
Dandan to ronri ga kuruu to shittete

00:01:52.437 --> 00:01:56.840
Nerau inochi ga moeru

00:01:57.375 --> 00:02:02.547
Isshu no kairaku, itai yo, mune

00:02:02.547 --> 00:02:06.851
Afuresou na seihai

00:02:06.851 --> 00:02:13.357
Shizumare, suberu made wa osaete

00:02:13.357 --> 00:02:20.298
Subete te ni iretai to kimeta, Lilith yo

00:02:20.298 --> 00:02:22.767
