00:02:36.614 --> 00:02:41.819
Kimi ga motomeru kyouchi ni wa todokisou ni nai

00:02:41.819 --> 00:02:44.422
I, I, I

00:02:44.422 --> 00:02:47.585
I'm in spiral

00:02:47.959 --> 00:02:50.928
Qwaser of Stigmata II

00:02:51.729 --> 00:02:52.630
