00:22:41.484 --> 00:22:43.153
Let no one lead you astray

00:22:43.153 --> 00:22:46.890
Shadan sareta kimi to no oratorio

00:22:46.890 --> 00:22:49.793
Aisetsu o tsuki ga terashite

00:22:49.793 --> 00:22:55.390
Aoku kagayaku asu e no eve

00:23:10.080 --> 00:23:10.880
Next Episode

00:23:10.880 --> 00:23:13.717
I wonder what Mafuyu and
the others are doing right now...

00:23:13.717 --> 00:23:17.887
Why did miss Oribe disappear
after Sasha transferred?

00:23:17.887 --> 00:23:19.022
That's a secret.

00:23:19.022 --> 00:23:21.191
As student council president,
I can't let this slide!

00:23:21.191 --> 00:23:25.028
Some things in this world are so frightening,
they should remain unknown.

00:23:25.028 --> 00:23:26.496
Can you handle it, Fumika?

00:23:26.496 --> 00:23:28.361
Wh-Wh-What should I do?

00:23:28.498 --> 00:23:30.300
Next time on Qwaser of Stigmata II,
"The Quartz Trap."

00:23:30.300 --> 00:23:31.568
The Quartz Trap

00:23:31.568 --> 00:23:34.471
Tremble! Kneel down in fear!

00:23:34.471 --> 00:23:34.994
The Quartz Trap
